  "body": "Decision record for issue #5853 (parent issue #5679, decomposition item 5): custom GUI rendering as first-class overrides.\n\nThe record settles: presentation overrides live in the target's override map (never in the semantic source), bound by instance or kind+variant+state; two presentation kinds (asset, drawn-by-registered-renderer); state completeness as a build-time error; structural fallback to the standard rendering; no essential content in presentations; native targets keep OS-standard controls per the parent. Alternatives rejected and why, and the invariants implementation must hold, are in the record. No parent (#5679) decision is changed — §5 of the record says so explicitly and names the one future question (native custom-drawn controls) that would need a superseding decision.\n\nDocs-only change; no implementation, per the issue.\n\nCloses #5853\n\nQueue: task 13254, lane code-o.\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1796733585&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=7684&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F7684&signature=e4d17639713367eaf2a896bad52b5992520c5dd9799ba14395467ca69dec7ec7\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup><a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/developing-today/codesmith/code/pr/7684?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\">Open in [code]smith</a> · Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\n\n<!-- codesmith